# Downloaded test datasets (fetched by scripts/fetch_test_data.py)
# Fetched/generated test data; the committed transit fixtures are
# negated back in (a directory-level ignore cannot be pierced, so the
# contents pattern is used). Henrikki, 2026-08-05: small transit-only
# subsets live in-repo.
tests/data/*
!tests/data/helsinki-transit.osm.pbf
!tests/data/helsinki-transit-gap.osm.pbf
!tests/data/helsinki-transit-missing.osm.pbf


